    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{4\\sqrt[3]9}{3}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac4{\\sqrt[3]3}&=\\frac{4\\sqrt[3]9}{\\sqrt[3]3\\times\\sqrt[3]9}\\\\\\frac4{\\sqrt[3]3}&=\\frac{4\\sqrt[3]9}{\\sqrt[3]{27}}\\\\\\frac4{\\sqrt[3]3}&=\\frac{4\\sqrt[3]9}{3}\\end{align*}$$",
